lass=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/c0e8e736d37a05a68543fc600d4389d1.poster.avif?t=1787795288\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/c0e8e736d37a05a68543fc600d4389d1.webm?t=1787795288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/c0e8e736d37a05a68543fc600d4389d1.mp4?t=1787795288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/4236c0f6bcddd9af160eb45c9a73f72c.avif?t=1787795288\" width=1060 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you spend time with the townsfolk, you grow closer to them, and slowly form bonds with them. But beneath these warm, everyday moments, the town hides something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A number—42—flickers above the museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden rainbow across the sky. A “heart-stealing ghost” haunts the well. Tentacles creep from the cracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What lies behind these mysteries?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps the one destined to uncover the truth… is you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/41148b2dfec317a4df8f2bdf185a753d.poster.avif?t=1787795288\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589500/extras/41148b2dfec317a4df8f2bd